<title>SWEDEN: H&amp;M says high expansion rate to continue.</title>
<headline>H&amp;M says high expansion rate to continue.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1997-01-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hennes &amp; Mauritz managing director Stefan Persson said on Friday there were no financial or geographical obstacles that could obstruct the Swedish fashion retailer's current high rate of expansion.</p>
<p>&quot;Financially we can continue at this high rate of expansion...Geographically I don't see any hindrances either,&quot; Persson said in a television interview.</p>
<p>He said the obstacles were more likely within the company.</p>
<p>&quot;The limits are more likely when it comes to the organisation and personnel...We are growing by 1,000 employees per year,&quot; Persson said.</p>
<p>-- Stockholm newsroom +46-8-700 1017</p>
